+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// The geometries of each property (a grammar built once per option set). The
+// GeoJSON grammars leave out the empty MultiPoint members (go-geom/2) and the
+// empty first members of Z/M multi-geometries (go-geom/3), and the WKT grammar
